# rapidculling
===
 A fast, Capture One-style RAW (and JPEG) culling app. Browse a folder, group near-duplicate frames by visual similarity, rate and pick/reject with single keystrokes, and drag finished shots straight into a folder — all in a native desktop app. Video demo below..
